{"data": [{"article": {"title": "Before You Give an AI Agent the Keys"}, "author_id": "1462677906774237184", "created_at": "2026-11-07T12:45:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119048542094319977"], "id": "2119048542094319977", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 56, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/9kj3psZxZj", "url": "https://x.com/Bagel8343/status/2119048542094319977"}, {"author_id": "1265140425406414853", "created_at": "2026-11-07T11:15:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119025836913311935"], "id": "2119025836913311935", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 89, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "# 65B That Outperformed 501B: Inside Ripple-65B's $32 Million Bet Against Scale\n\nThe large language model industry has spent the last two years moving in one direction: more parameters, more experts, more money. Ricursive Intelligence went the other way. Their Ripple-65B", "url": "https://x.com/VitaliiKhomenk1/status/2119025836913311935"}, {"author_id": "2047623249333559296", "created_at": "2026-11-07T09:03:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118992741598413246"], "id": "2118992741598413246", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2425151", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109701133744943286", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Meta Muse Wonder on agentic tasks is the right wedge — consumer AI is already crowded. The enterprise workflow moat is where the margin actually lives.", "url": "https://x.com/BlueTearsPT/status/2118992741598413246"}, {"article": {"title": "先别让 AI 替你做决定"}, "author_id": "1462677906774237184", "created_at": "2026-11-07T08:06:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118978267898081720"], "id": "2118978267898081720", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 365, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/P6rP6HIifo", "url": "https://x.com/Bagel8343/status/2118978267898081720"}, {"article": {"title": "Make Money with Meta Muse Spaces: Sell AI Workspace Setups to Small Businesses"}, "author_id": "2437331952", "created_at": "2026-11-07T07:40:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118971861056843998"], "id": "2118971861056843998", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 134, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/o93sUGU20J", "url": "https://x.com/TanveerDhool/status/2118971861056843998"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2118901640086315008", "3_2118901714400997376", "3_2118901770596372480"]}, "author_id": "979737336", "created_at": "2026-11-07T06:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118954100779848102"], "id": "2118954100779848102", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 84, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🎬 Someone built an open-source bridge that lets Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, and other AI agents generate and edit images and videos using your existing Meta Muse account.\n\nIt's called Muse4AI, an unofficial Windows application that exposes Muse's creative features through REST, https://t.co/0k8OF5Hwds", "url": "https://x.com/cutetoxicguy/status/2118954100779848102"}, {"author_id": "1982395147506917377", "created_at": "2026-11-07T04:44:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118927511484842440"], "id": "2118927511484842440", "in_reply_to_user_id": "615818451", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 88, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118776727912755478", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@alexandr_wang Thank you! Meta Muse Wonder is a beast, orchestrates multi-steps much more consistently than other models, and believe me I tried them. You Meta folks cooked HARD", "url": "https://x.com/psychoid_layer/status/2118927511484842440"}, {"author_id": "2117288661146312704", "created_at": "2026-11-07T04:00:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118916517353984507"], "id": "2118916517353984507", "in_reply_to_user_id": "727598020745797632", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117309534528028848", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2118500863711084574", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@LatamData Seeing Meta Muse roll out across emerging markets is huge. We just built @docarion_hq on Meta Muse Spark, Muse Wonder &amp; SAM 3.1 for the @AIatMeta × @CerebralValley Global Hackathon—connecting patients, clinicians, pharmacies, and hospitals across Africa with multilingual triage https://t.co/aU7Lzu0fwN", "url": "https://x.com/docarion_hq/status/2118916517353984507"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2118911514992410624"]}, "author_id": "146108201", "created_at": "2026-11-07T03:40:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118911553517105252"], "id": "2118911553517105252", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 101, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta adds Spaces so Muse agents can keep a project\n\nMuse now gets a sidebar that behaves like a project tab. Describe a vacation, a wedding, a gift tracker, or a DIY board in chat and Muse builds a Space for it. Connect third-party apps and the Space updates in the background — https://t.co/EDdUxCHchP", "url": "https://x.com/Tesla_Optimus_K/status/2118911553517105252"}, {"article": {"title": "MuseでX検索、noteのネタ探しを試しました"}, "author_id": "2017902510347030529", "created_at": "2026-11-07T00:26:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118862561668186381"], "id": "2118862561668186381", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1728, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/utUI5Ej6dQ", "url": "https://x.com/MKzK417/status/2118862561668186381"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["7_2118862254074372096"]}, "author_id": "1902887712073584642", "created_at": "2026-11-07T00:25:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118862282645999837"], "id": "2118862282645999837", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Built a holiday gift tracker in Meta Muse Spaces in about 3 minutes. One prompt, then a budget total and a festive redesign.\n\nhonestly better than I expected. still can't share it with anyone though 👀 https://t.co/QNyZkvux0o", "url": "https://x.com/JaySym_/status/2118862282645999837"}, {"article": {"title": "456X Evening Brief — November 6, 2026: Rising Expansion Costs as Microsoft Reallocates Leased"}, "author_id": "849661480869912576", "created_at": "2026-11-06T22:15:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118829564659105953"], "id": "2118829564659105953", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1602, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/30os85Emdd", "url": "https://x.com/OptionKing666/status/2118829564659105953"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["7_2118829124462505984"]}, "author_id": "969822335502036992", "created_at": "2026-11-06T22:14:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118829355241455651"], "id": "2118829355241455651", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 265, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "We gave Google Gemini a robot dog body. 🐕\n\nOne sentence, three moves: walk forward, turn right 60°, shake hands. Our founder Dr. Rongzhong Li built the demo.\n\nAfter Meta Muse, Gemini is the second AI model on Quaddle. Open-source OpenCat means other AI models can plug in too. https://t.co/u5yrP3Z8om", "url": "https://x.com/PetoiCamp/status/2118829355241455651"}, {"article": {"title": "AI Daily, Nov 6: GPT-6 Cyber, Gemini Omni 1.2, Inkling 2 Small"}, "author_id": "1508034028670181376", "created_at": "2026-11-06T20:33:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118804003689820571"], "id": "2118804003689820571", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 896, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "https://t.co/NcuzzS2FMt", "url": "https://x.com/moocat999/status/2118804003689820571"}, {"author_id": "1989721686477082626", "created_at": "2026-11-06T19:54:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118794239622664434"], "id": "2118794239622664434", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 64, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Here is this morning’s daily roundup of emerging AI utilities, voice agents, and automation tools launched or updated over the past 24 to 48 hours, selected for technical execution, autonomy, and practical workflow value.\n🛠️ Emerging AI Utilities\n1. Underdog Woof\n * Overview:", "url": "https://x.com/WinnD923/status/2118794239622664434"}, {"author_id": "716250764939698178", "created_at": "2026-11-06T19:54:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118794127538323794"], "id": "2118794127538323794", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 198, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Three things I learned building an AI agent for creators during a 10-day hackathon, including what broke.\n\nBilling can stop everything. For days, every Meta Muse call returned “402 Payment Required.” The app fell back to Claude, so it still worked. Now I treat “payment required”", "url": "https://x.com/amyboiss/status/2118794127538323794"}, {"author_id": "1466294274111115265", "created_at": "2026-11-06T17:47:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118762237061910737"], "id": "2118762237061910737", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "InvoicePilot: an AI accounts-payable agent on Meta Muse open weights.\n\nDrop in an invoice. It extracts the facts, writes an audit script, runs it in a locked sandbox, and only pays the bank account already on file.\n\nBuilt for the Meta Global AI Developer Hackathon.\nRepo:", "url": "https://x.com/ChanochRosen/status/2118762237061910737"}, {"author_id": "2054964520569675777", "created_at": "2026-11-06T15:44:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118731138210402560"], "id": "2118731138210402560", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1756394384655003648", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 33, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118714967147053420", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@theaaron @Meta @Muse Such a smooth workflow!", "url": "https://x.com/raphaelmalims/status/2118731138210402560"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2118723352487452672"]}, "author_id": "1203776593459662848", "created_at": "2026-11-06T15:13:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118723357168247189"], "id": "2118723357168247189", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 342, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Don’t see it mentioned a ton on the side of X that feeds my TL but @Meta Muse is probably doing more than anything to onboard the average person into using AI. \n\nAI Assistant bot is so intuitive and easy to use. I was using AI here and there for things but now using it daily and https://t.co/buTGuzBZ2q", "url": "https://x.com/FitDadRx/status/2118723357168247189"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2118717386673049600"]}, "author_id": "1851664989884682243", "created_at": "2026-11-06T14:49:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118717392075252158"], "id": "2118717392075252158", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 65, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta Muse is launching voice AI features, but nobody asked for them\n\nThat’s the exact mood I caught from comments on socials. Meta just rolled out real-time voice calls with AI avatars in Meta Muse. Hundreds of voices, live lip-syncing, interruption support... the tech is https://t.co/oUsBA03fWT", "url": "https://x.com/olhapivnenko/status/2118717392075252158"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-06T14:44:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118716048086044979"], "id": "2118716048086044979", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3094951661", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118715906255962298", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ralf_naumann @bot Alternativen zu Grok Bot ():\n\nHosted: Claude Duet (ab Claude Pro ~20 $/Mo), Meta Muse (Free-Tier US/CA), OpenAI Dots (ChatGPT Pro), Manus (ab Free/Pro 20 $).\n\nOpen-Source/Self-Hosted (günstiger bei Eigenbetrieb): OpenClaw, Hermes Agent, Rakazo, MausBot.\n\nJe nach Use-Case", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2118716048086044979"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2118702272498851841"]}, "author_id": "1904404123841122304", "created_at": "2026-11-06T13:49:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118702427641926089"], "id": "2118702427641926089", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "using muse wonder full 1.0 on several workers at once and in automated workflows and haven't come close to my meta muse max weekly limit. next week will be the bigger test. https://t.co/k1cNlhWPTI", "url": "https://x.com/a017444/status/2118702427641926089"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-06T13:09:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118692230349074651"], "id": "2118692230349074651", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2076661667694305280", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118692086228668580", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@n1xonweb @ronisarkar_exe A few solid reasons Grok Bot edges Meta Muse for many:\n\nIt runs multiple specialized teammates in parallel on one persistent cloud computer that signs into your actual tools and finishes multi-step work while you are away.\n\nYou can teach any routine by simply showing it once,", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2118692230349074651"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["16_2118680915526266880"]}, "author_id": "1836195980347084800", "created_at": "2026-11-06T12:24:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118680921641500730"], "id": "2118680921641500730", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 5393, "like_count": 62, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Meta Muse is a money pit $META \n\n&gt; Agents are expensive\n&gt; Cash flow is neg\n&gt; Muse is free\n\nWhat a disaster …\n\nMeta should just:\n\n&gt; Make Reels crack cocaine\n&gt; Rent out compute\n&gt; Run better ads \n\n… right? \n\nNo. Dead fucking wrong.\n\n&gt; Give value for free\n&gt; Build data flywheels\n&gt; https://t.co/kBcEqWeFa0", "url": "https://x.com/corleonecapital/status/2118680921641500730"}, {"article": {"title": "456X Semi — AI 2026-11-06 Memory Weekly"}, "author_id": "849661480869912576", "created_at": "2026-11-06T11:21:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118664982204436711"], "id": "2118664982204436711", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 646, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/FCuhvFy2iM", "url": "https://x.com/OptionKing666/status/2118664982204436711"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2118901640086315008", 